  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1766212064_4172296_67302be38d7b611bd37ffa88b474765b.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h2><strong>OROVÉ® — Private Luxury Access &amp; Partner Program</strong></h2><p>OROVÉ® is a members-only luxury concierge specializing in the acquisition of premium timepieces, designer eyewear, and curated luxury accessories. All acquisitions are facilitated through a private international network and routed through Texas for verification prior to delivery.</p><p>OROVÉ® operates on a membership-based access model that unlocks preferred pricing unavailable to the public, fixed concierge pricing, and priority sourcing. The brand is structured for discretion, consistency, and long-term client relationships rather than mass retail volume.</p><p>In addition to luxury acquisitions, OROVÉ® members receive access to a <strong>members-only apparel</strong>, including monthly apparel allotments issued by access level. This apparel program is not available for public purchase and is reserved exclusively for active members.</p><hr><h3><strong>Partner Opportunity</strong></h3><p>Approved partners earn <strong>10% commission on every qualified sale</strong> introduced through their private Partner Access Link.</p><ul><li><p>High average order values</p></li><li><p>Transparent earnings tracking via a private Partner Console</p></li><li><p>No inventory, fulfillment, or customer support responsibilities</p></li><li><p>Payouts processed after a standard review period</p></li></ul><p>The program is designed for connectors, creators, and professionals with access to luxury-interested audiences and high-trust relationships.</p><hr><h3><strong>What Makes OROVÉ® Different</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Membership-based access to private pricing tiers</p></li><li><p>Fixed concierge pricing instead of fluctuating retail markups</p></li><li><p>Curated selections without mass listings</p></li><li><p>Texas-based verification prior to delivery</p></li><li><p>Complimentary premium presentation, documentation, and insured shipping</p></li><li><p>Members-only apparel program reinforcing lifestyle alignment</p></li></ul><hr><h3><strong>Who This Is For</strong></h3><p>OROVÉ® is built for individuals who understand access, discretion, and long-term positioning.</p><p>Partners succeed through alignment, not volume.</p><blockquote><br></blockquote></div>",
