  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family:Philosopher;\"><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:2px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Welcome to OROVÉ! Thanks for joining our Partner program.</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>These following terms and conditions apply to individuals who are accessing or using the Program both as a merchant (\"we\" or \"merchant\") and a partner (\"you\" or \"partner\") who refers customers to use product or service from the merchant.</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>By participating in the Program, Partner agrees to use the Program in the manner specified in, and are bound by, these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these Terms and Conditions in their entirety you are not authorized to register as a Partner or participate in the Program in any manner.</span></p><ol start=\"1\" class=\"_ol_16yqn_93\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span>Approve or Reject of the Registration</span></li></ol><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:2px 0px 8px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>We reserve the right to approve or reject ANY Partner Program Registration in our sole and absolute discretion. You will have no legal recourse against us for the rejection of your Partner Program Registration.</span></p><ol start=\"2\" class=\"_ol_16yqn_93\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span>Partner Links and Coupon</span></li></ol><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:2px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Partner link is automatically generated, but you can also generate a partner link for a specific product or collection. If a person clicks on someone else's referral link and then later they click on yours, yours is the one that counts.</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Partner might or might not be assigned to one coupon code with details and usage clarified on Dashboard. If customer both click on the partner link and use coupon code, you will not receive a double commission. If you're not assigned a branded coupon, then you're not allowed to promote the coupon.</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Partner may also advertise merchant website on online channels such as Facebook, Instagram,... or offline classified channel ads, magazines, and newspapers.</span></p><ol start=\"3\" class=\"_ol_16yqn_93\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span>Commissions and payment</span></li></ol><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:2px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Refer any customer to make a purchase on our website, you will get a commission amount which is calculated based on Commission structure. Commission amount is dependent on order value and not including extra fee (tax, shipping cost,...).</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>For a Partner to receive a commission, you need to specify the payment details on Settings. Payment schedule will be notified on Partner Guide page.</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Payments will only be sent for transactions that have been successfully completed. Use of the Partner Program is subject to a fair use policy which gives merchant the right to review each and every referral order. Status of commission if displayed in Commission tab, any paid commission will be listed on Payment tab. Transactions that result in charge backs or refunds will not be paid out.</span></p><ol start=\"4\" class=\"_ol_16yqn_93\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span>Marketing tool</span></li></ol><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:2px 0px 8px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>We may share promotion media such as banner, logo or specific collection promotion to you through Marketing tool tab. You can download the media or get the HTML embed code in order to share on partner channels.</span></p><ol start=\"5\" class=\"_ol_16yqn_93\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span>Network</span></li></ol><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:2px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>If Network tab is activated, partner can invite others to become their downline partner. If any downline partner brings order to merchant shop, upline partner will also get network commission which depends on merchant settings.</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>To invite other partners into the system, share network link and any other partner who click on that link and sign up will become a downline partner.</span></p><ol start=\"6\" class=\"_ol_16yqn_93\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span>Cookie</span></li></ol><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:2px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>We use a cookie to track people who have clicked on your link, so they need to be using cookies for us to track them.</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>If a person doesn't allow cookies or clears their cookies then we can't track them so can't pay earnings on that person's activity.</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Cookies day is said on the Partner registration form. The tracking day will start from the time a customer clicks on the partner's link or use the coupon. Within the cookie time, every order made by this customer at merchant website will automatically result in commissions to the partner (There's no need for the customer to click on the partner link then).</span></p><ol start=\"7\" class=\"_ol_16yqn_93\"><li style=\"line-height:20px;padding-bottom:0px;\"><span>Removal from Referral Program</span></li></ol><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:2px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>If a partner wishes to be removed from the partner program, they can do so by contacting: partners@oroveglobal.com.</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>Go forward and refer!</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>We're very glad you've made it to the end of this important document.</span></p><p class=\"_p_16yqn_68\" style=\"margin:8px 0px 0px;font-size:13px;color:rgb(48,48,48);font-family:Inter, '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'San Francisco', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span>We wish you all the very best. You can always re-visit these Partner Program terms and conditions in the future and if you have any questions you can send email to partners@oroveglobal.com for support.</span></p></div>",
